# Push north beside the wall, turn into it and keep pushing: the skater slides along it and never passes through.
# At 9 m/s a full-lean turn opens to about a 7 m radius (10 m before the feel pass's park carve), so it meets
# the wall steeply, loses the speed into the wall (9 -> 5 m/s; 7 before) and scrapes along it to its end at y = 10.
park lab
spawn lab_wall
hold up 0..600
hold left 200..300
run 600
expect min skater.pos.x > -27.59 over 0..430
expect max skater.pos.x < -27.5 over 345..425
expect min skater.speed > 4.8 over 330..430
expect state ground at end
